        }
      ],
      "show_if": {
        "pictures": "paintings"
      },
      "help": "All on fal.ai, all painting from the photograph. Nano Banana is faithful and cheap, and keeps the more abstract styles (low-poly, charcoal, toy bricks, stained glass) close to the photograph; Nano Banana Pro and FLUX follow those styles further."
    },
    {
      "name": "ufo",
      "type": "slider",
      "label": "Chance of a UFO",
      "default": 0,
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "%",
      "show_if": {
        "pictures": "paintings"
      },
      "help": "Each hour, this chance that an unidentified contact joins the page, painted in the page's style, with no transponder and a made-up height and bearing. For fun. Each craft in a style is one painting against the daily limit."
